** sym_path: /home/raiku/k/heichips26-voltage-controlled-resistor/IHP-Open-PDK/ihp-sg13cmos5l/libs.tech/xschem/sg13g2_tests_xyce/mc_res_op.sym
** sch_path: /home/raiku/k/heichips26-voltage-controlled-resistor/IHP-Open-PDK/ihp-sg13cmos5l/libs.tech/xschem/sg13g2_tests_xyce/mc_res_op.sch
.subckt mc_res_op
